{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-139970" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $W$ be a $9\\times 10$ matrix that has $8$ pivot columns. What is the dimension of the null space of $W?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068410/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef2854a434979cbab911779753be3eb362d3eb5967a19581efb2e46e934074d7"} {"question" "q-139970" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We know that $\\text{dim(Null}(W))$ is the number of non-pivot columns in $W.$ \n\nSince $W$ has $10$ columns and $8$ of them are pivots, then the number of non-pivot columns in $W$ is \n\n$$\n10-8=2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{dim(Null}(W))=2.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068410/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef2854a434979cbab911779753be3eb362d3eb5967a19581efb2e46e934074d7"} {"question" "q-139970" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068410/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a5606ebf5f1faebbaffe824e7acbab6e7e461c64b72d4531435a2c3f726ca433"} {"question" "q-139970" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068410/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef2854a434979cbab911779753be3eb362d3eb5967a19581efb2e46e934074d7"} {"question" "q-139970" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "1"] ["math" "2"] ["math" "4"] ["math" "5"] ["math" "8"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068410/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef2854a434979